      "created_at": "2017-08-17T17:50:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Since the Android store isn't device locked, I decided to be a guinea pig for kicks and the game actually seems to work OK on my tablet (a Samsung Galaxy Tab S2).</p><p>The only hiccup I've found so far is that if you try clicking the Graphics button after reaching All-Star the game hangs instead of cycling the option.</p><p>Also I'm terrible at pitch choosing/guessing. &gt;_&gt;;</p>",
